  "releaseNotes": "Updates\n\t\t- Updates IronSoftware.System.Drawing to 2025.9.3.\n\t\t\n\t\tBug Fixes\n\t\t- Fixes an issue where duplicated slides are created on chained saving of a presentation file.\n\t\t- Fixes an issue where reloading some presentation files causes a color parser format exception.\n\t\t- Fixes an issue where removing a slide throws an exception error message.\n\t\t- Fixes an issue where Replace() method adds image instead of replacing it on the original image.\n\t\t- Fixes an issue where some text colors have an undefined color code.",
